. .
. to arbitration,&quot; and such arbitrations are held&nbsp;[**7]&nbsp;
&quot;pursuant to simplified procedures.&quot; </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:69YT-VDB3-RRT0-43KY-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>N.Y. Ins. Law
&sect; 5106(b)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-f=
areast-font-family:
Times;color:black'>. Insurers must accordingly include a mandatory personal
injury protection endorsement in their liability policies providing for the
option to arbitrate. <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See</i> </span=
><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dadministrative-cod=
es&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:67K1-VMD1-JJK6-S51X-00009-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>N.Y. Comp. Co=
des
R. &amp; Regs. tit. 11, &sect; 65-1.1</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-fam=
ily:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal1 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;line-height:15.0pt'><br>
<b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times"=
,serif;
