serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>3. Balance of Hardships</span></=
i></p>

<p class=3DNormal1 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Third,
we consider whether State Farm demonstrated that the balance of hardships t=
ips
decidedly in its favor. <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See </i></s=
pan><a
