k'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc14"></a>In determining whether State Farm has
satisfied this requirement, &quot;we must 'balance the competing claims of
injury and must consider the effect on each party of the&nbsp;[**42]&nbsp;
granting or withholding of the requested relief.'&quot; <i style=3D'mso-bid=
i-font-style:
normal'>Yang v. Kosinski, 960 F.3d 119, 135 (2d Cir. 2020)</i>, quoting </s=
pan><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
