if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 555 U.S. 7,=
 24,
129 S. Ct. 365, 172 L. Ed. 2d 249 (2008)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-=
family:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. This factor is
&quot;related&quot; to the irreparable harm requirement as &quot;both . . .
consider the harm to the parties&quot; with the relevant harm being
&nbsp;[*85]&nbsp; that which &quot;(a) occurs to the parties' legal interes=
ts
and (b) cannot be remedied after a final adjudication, whether by damages o=
r a
permanent injunction.&quot; </span><a
