:contentItem:5X62-BFJ1-F81W-20J1-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, No. 18-CV-2=
463,
2019 U.S. Dist. LEXIS 171592, 2019 WL 11027710 (S.D.N.Y. Sep. 30, 2019)</sp=
an></i></a><span
