:contentItem:5X62-BFJ1-F81W-20J1-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>2019 U.S. Dis=
t.
LEXIS 171592, [WL] at *5</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",s=
