0000400"></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>To
be sure, &quot;[s]tatements of literal truth 'can become, through their con=
text
and manner of presentation, devices which mislead investors.'&quot; <i
