:contentItem:57MX-2X71-F04K-J034-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 706 F.3d 14=
5,
153 (2d Cir. 2013)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (quoting </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29ST62D6MX30010000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-5YC0-003B-52NV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>McMahan &amp;=
 Co.
v. Wherehouse Entm't, Inc.</span></i></a><a
