name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29ST62SF8S20010000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>[F]inancial professionals have
developed specific metrics . . . to perform valuations of companies, their
stock prices, and the like. Thus, a statement that a deal is &quot;fair&quo=
t;
reasonably may be understood as a statement, or at least as an implication,
that the opinion reflects or is based upon one or more accepted valuation
