:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>If the directors' statements abo=
ut
the fairness of the deal . . . are not grounded in &quot;the customs and
practices of the relevant industry,&quot; they&nbsp;[**26]&nbsp; &quot;coul=
d be
misleadingly incomplete&quot; . . . . because the reasonable person, who
&quot;understands a statement of opinion in its full context,&quot; would
expect &quot;not just that the issuer believes the opinion (however
irrationally),&quot; but that the opinion &quot;rests on some meaningful . =
. .
inquiry . . . .&quot;</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal2 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><a
