<p class=3DNormal2 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Nor
does the dissent's distinction make sense on its own merits. Simply put, th=
ere
is no reason for a minority shareholder to vote for or against a freeze-out
