if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Waggoner v.
Barclays PLC</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5PWP-PRH1-F04K-J1D9-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
