href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-0490-008H-V0T3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Wilson</span>=
</i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-0490-008H-V0T3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 979 F.2d at=
 931</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
(&quot;[L]oss causation or economic harm to plaintiffs must be shown, as we=
ll
as proof that the misrepresentations induced plaintiffs to engage in the
subject transaction, that is, transaction causation.&quot;); <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>see </i></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29STK2SF7MB0050000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:531M-TPM1-F04K-F3WJ-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Halliburton I=
</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:531M-TPM1-F04K-F3WJ-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 563 U.S. at=
 812</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
(contrasting loss causation and transaction causation). <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29STK28T4NM0030000400_2"></a>Loss causation, in contras=
t, is
adequately alleged by pleading that &quot;the loss be foreseeable and that =
the
loss be caused by the materialization of [ ] concealed risk.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29STK28T4NM0020000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4F98-0CY0-0038-X3SH-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
