"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal2 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_II08GTF069SX003RS0V2005S0"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29STR28T4PY0010000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_II08GTF069SX003RS0V2005RY"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29STR28T4PY0030000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>To state a claim for securities
fraud under </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8S9D-W4W2-8T6X-700R-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>section 10(b)=
</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
and </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dadministrative-cod=
es&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:603K-8JY1-DYB7-W40R-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>rule 10b-5</s=
pan></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>, a
private plaintiff must plead transaction causation. </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_II08GTF069SX003RS0V2005RW"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29STR28T4PY0050000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29STR2HM6740050000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4F98-0CY0-0038-X3SH-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Lentell v.
Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4F98-0CY0-0038-X3SH-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 396 F.3d 16=
1,
172 (2d Cir. 2005)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_II08GTF069SX003RS0V2005RT"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_II08GTF069SX003RS0V2005RR"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29STS2HM6790020000400"></a>&quot;Transaction causation =
is
akin to reliance, and requires only an allegation that 'but for the claimed
misrepresentations or omissions, the plaintiff would not have entered into =
the
detrimental securities transaction.'&quot; <u>Id.</u> &nbsp;[*64]&nbsp;
