the implied right of minority shareholders to bring claims based on proxy
statements issued in connection with proposed corporate mergers. Minority
shareholders have a cognizable claim for securities fraud when&nbsp;[**71]&=
nbsp;
a challenged proxy statement constitutes &quot;an essential link in the
accomplishment of the transaction.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6F29STS28T4R50010000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
