vote).</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal2 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Freeze-out
mergers are different in this decisive respect: in a freeze-out merger, the
controlling shareholder owns so many shares that its unilateral vote in fav=
or
