Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Monk plausibly alleges that Shan=
da's
proxy statements misrepresented Shanda's financial outlook and that the
negotiated merger price was unfair. But these allegations alone would not s=
tate
a claim under the federal securities law absent the majority's decision to
obviate </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8S9D-W4W2-8T6X-700R-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
