style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 443 F.3d at=
 266</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
(in class action against professional advisors for improper and fraudulent =
tax
counseling, holding that some class members failed to meet the clear and
definite damages element of civil RICO because some members had not yet been
assessed a tax penalty); </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I5C9CHD528T4Y7002000040=
0"></a><a
