style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Id</i>. (emphasis added). <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5C9CHD52SF8V30010000400"></a>In other words, separate and=
 apart
from the issue of plaintiff's status as a secured creditor, <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Uzan</i> holds that a plaintiff's dama=
ges
are not &quot;clear and definite&quot; so long as that plaintiff's damages
