:contentItem:3SB6-SS90-0038-Y4WW-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 7 F. Supp. =
2d
277 (S.D.N.Y. 1998)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (<i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-styl=
