mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Associated Ge=
n.
Contractors, Inc. v. Carpenters</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-5500-003B-S0SB-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
