lly
included in the concept of proximate causation is the requirement that ther=
e be
&quot;some direct relation between the injury asserted and the injurious
conduct alleged.&quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4F8XMV10K1MND4SD0000400"=
></a><a
