yle:
normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Ti=
mes;
color:black'>Holmes</span></i><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> emphasized that although the di=
rect
injury test &quot;is not the sole requirement of [proximate] causation, it =
has
been one of its central elements.&quot; </span><a
