<p class=3DNormal6 style=3D'text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>(Affidavit
of Nicholas Blinov dated October 21, 1992, PP 3-6.)</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal6 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>In
a Memorandum and Order dated March 31, 1993 (&quot;Decision&quot;), the
