59,
1067 (2d Cir. 1985)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FDVMMS0K1MNJ41G0000400_2"></a>Representations tending to
indicate that the valuation of the shares to be purchased has been inflated=
 may
obviously be material. <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See</i>, <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>e.g.</i>, </span><a
