:contentItem:5F8N-V9R1-F04K-J00Y-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 778 F.3d 39=
0,
394 (2d Cir. 2015)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (upholding jurisdiction where t=
he
appellants &quot;disclaim[ed] any intent to revive their dismissed claim&qu=
ot;
in a reply brief); </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I64KM5GN2HM6360030000400"></a=
><a
