:contentItem:5GB3-N3M1-F04K-J029-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>16 Casa Duse,=
 LLC
v. Merkin</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5GB3-N3M1-F04K-J029-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 791 F.3d 24=
7,
255 (2d Cir. 2015)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (upholding jurisdiction where t=
he
appellant &quot;agreed to a dismissal of his remaining claim . . . with
