see
also </i></span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I64KM5GN2HM6360050000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-B8D0-001B-K11N-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Atlanta Shipp=
ing
Corp. v. Chemical Bank</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-B8D0-001B-K11N-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
