the
picture. <a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc12_6"></a>Although the Bankruptcy =
Court
has the inherent authority to investigate and remedy fraud on the court, <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>see </i></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I64KM5GV2HM6450040000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S65-KS90-003B-R0W9-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
