k'>,
we have no reason to believe that a belated investigation may be launched i=
nto
an already-closed matter.</span><a style=3D'mso-footnote-id:ftn77' href=3D"=
#_ftn77"
name=3D"_ftnref77" title=3D""><sup><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times'>5</span></sup></a><span style=3D'font-family=
:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> That task is usually assigned to
the United States Attorney's Office. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I64KM5GV2N1RSD0020000400_2"></a>To be sure, in an ordinary=
 civil
or criminal case, a court would &quot;vacate its own judgment upon proof th=
at a
fraud has been perpetrated upon the court.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I64KM5GV2N1RSD0010000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S65-KS90-003B-R0W9-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Chambers</spa=
n></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S65-KS90-003B-R0W9-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 501 U.S. at=
 44</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I64KM5GV2N1RSD0040000400"></a>While, theoretically, that m=
ay
also be possible here, we are not persuaded that, under the circumstances
presented here, either the Bankruptcy Court or the U.S. Trustee would be in=
 a
superior position to find out what McKinsey did (or did not do). In other
words, adjudicating any potential claims of the U.S. Trustee or the
Bankruptcy&nbsp;[**25]&nbsp; Court would not be more
&quot;straightforward&quot; than adjudicating Alix's claims. <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See </i></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I64KM5GV2N1RSD0030000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5T4K-YBH1-F2MB-S4B9-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Empire Mercha=
nts</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5T4K-YBH1-F2MB-S4B9-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 902 F.3d at=
 144</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
(quoting </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I64KM5GV2N1RSD0050000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4K41-DS80-004C-200J-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Anza</span></=
i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4K41-DS80-004C-200J-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 547 U.S. at=
 460</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>).
For these reasons, we conclude that Alix has alleged a sufficiently direct
relationship between the asserted injury to AlixPartners and McKinsey's
