&nbsp;[**2]&nbsp; The senior executives named in the complaint, George F.
Taylor and Irwin Engelman, were also sued as &quot;controlling persons&quot;
under Section 20 of the 1934 Act.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </=
