 <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>i.e.</i>, that defendants&nbsp;[**22]&=
nbsp;
knew of the import restrictions at the time they made the allegedly fraudul=
ent
statements. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I7H39KCH6MG00000CYY00023"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FDMNS60K1MNJ3B60000400"></a><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FDMNS60K1MNJ39C0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-9CS0-003B-515C-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Id.</span></i=
></a><a
