stock sales, the <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Goldman</i> defend=
ants
sold tens of thousands of shares during the period that the allegedly defra=
uded
customers were purchasing them.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </sp=
an></span><a
