k'>.&nbsp;[**23]&nbsp;
<a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc11_7"></a>Absent some comparable allegation=
 to
explain how a defendant benefits from an inflated stock price, stock owners=
hip
does not provide sufficient motive to sustain the pleading burden under </s=
pan><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
