reasonably presumed to have expertise, to have access to internal corporate
information, and to owe an obligation to exercise judgment in the interest =
of
the stockholders. <a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc12_7"></a>A statement of
reasons, opinion or belief by such a person when recommending a course of
