ered
the country, nor claims that Colin had knowledge of how those workers came =
to
the United States. It alleges that Colin's participation in
the&nbsp;[**6]&nbsp; affairs of the enterprise through the illegal immigrant
hiring scheme violates <a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc3_10"></a><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span></span><a
