style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4F54HVJ0K1MND0TF0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-1Y80-006F-M1R4-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>De Jesus v.
Sears, Roebuck &amp; Co.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-1Y80-006F-M1R4-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
