ts
injury and Colin's pattern of racketeering activity. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4F54HVJ0K1MND13W0000400"></a>The <i style=3D'mso-bidi-fon=
t-style:
normal'>Holmes</i> Court gave three policy reasons for limiting RICO's civil
