for
violation of a court order is an extreme and harsh remedy. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4F54HVJ0K1MND1BV0000400"></a><i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-st=
yle:
normal'>See </i><span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span></span><a
