0,
122 L. Ed. 2d 525, 113 S. Ct. 1163 (1993)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font=
-family:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>, the Supreme Court
considered the meaning of </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
