k'>'s
requirement that a person employed by or associated with any enterprise
&quot;conduct or participate, directly or indirectly, in the conduct of such
enterprise's affairs through a pattern of racketeering activity.&quot; The
Court held that <a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc18_4"></a>&quot;one is not =
liable
under </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>[&sect; 1962(=
c)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>]
unless one has <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>participated in the
operation or management of the enterprise itself</i>.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4F0WVM10K1MND1060000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S70-NFC0-003B-R50T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Id</span></i>=
</a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S70-NFC0-003B-R50T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>. at 185</spa=
n></i></a><span
