k'>
(emphasis added). <a name=3D"Bookmark_I75075MJB8W000D07DC00022"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4F0WVM10K1MND1160000400"></a>Under the &quot;operation and
management&quot; test, a defendant must have &quot;some part in directing t=
he
enterprise's affairs.<a name=3D"Bookmark_I4F0WVM10K1MND1160000400_2"></a>
&nbsp;[**42]&nbsp; &quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4F0WVM10K1MND10800004=
00"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S70-NFC0-003B-R50T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Id.</span></i=
></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S70-NFC0-003B-R50T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
