mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Lujan v.
Defenders of Wildlife, 504 U.S. 555, 563, 119 L. Ed. 2d 351, 112 S. Ct. 2130
(1992)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-f=
ont-family:
Times;color:black'> (&quot;The 'injury in fact' test [for constitutional
