if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Thompson, 15 =
F.3d
at 249</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-f=
ont-family:
Times;color:black'> (noting that the party invoking the jurisdiction of the
