2001. Eternity appeals from a final judgment entered in the United States
District Court for the Southern District of New York (McKenna, <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>J.</i>), dismissing with prejudice its
complaint alleging breach of contract, fraud, and negligent misrepresentati=
on
