sovereign bonds of Argentina and would be &quot;triggered&quot; upon the
occurrence of a &quot;credit event,&quot; such that if Argentina restructur=
ed
or defaulted on that debt, Eternity would have the right to put to Morgan a
stipulated amount of the bonds for purchase at par value. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal15 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
