p of
economic crisis, initiated a &quot;voluntary debt exchange&quot; in which
bondholders had the option of turning in their bonds for secured loans on t=
erms
less favorable except that the loans were secured by certain Argentine fede=
ral
tax revenues. Eternity informed Morgan that&nbsp;[**3]&nbsp; the voluntary =
debt
exchange was a credit event that triggered &nbsp;[*171]&nbsp; Morgan's
obligations under the CDS contracts. Morgan disagreed. </span></p>

