The swaps would be triggered upon occurrence of any one of four credit
events--as defined by the 1999 ISDA Credit Derivative Definitions--with res=
pect
to the Argentine sovereign bonds: Failure to pay, Obligation Acceleration,
Repudiation/Moratorium, and Restructuring.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal15 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bott=
om:0in;
