Upon notification (by either party to the other) of a credit event, and
confirmation&nbsp;[**15]&nbsp; via two publicly available sources of
information (<i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>e.g.</i>, the Wall Str=
eet
Journal), and </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal15 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bott=
om:0in;
margin-left:20.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:15.=
0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>(b)
delivery to Morgan of the requisite amount of Argentine sovereign bonds, </=
span></p>

<p class=3DNormal15 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bott=
om:0in;
margin-left:20.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:15.=
0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
