Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>&nbsp;[*175]&nbsp; The parties
dispute whether any of certain actions taken by Argentina with respect to i=
ts
debt obligations in November and December 2001 constituted a credit event. =
The
district court thought not, and dismissed Eternity's contract claim at the
pleading stage. </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4F252FJ0K1MND3760000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:48TB-X2B0-0038-Y1HX-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
