if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 2003 U.S. D=
ist.
LEXIS 12351, 2003 WL 21305355, at *4-6</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-fa=
mily:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. With the backgro=
und
and structure of the disputed CDS contracts in mind, we turn to Eternity's
