<p class=3DNormal15 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>On
November 15, 2002, Eternity filed a second amended complaint, primarily to
supplement facts bearing on its misrepresentation claims. <a
