style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 98 N.Y.2d 5=
62,
569, 780 N.E.2d 166, 750 N.Y.S.2d 565 (2002).</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>&nbsp;[**24]&nbsp;
<a name=3D"Bookmark_I4F252FJ0K1MND3G80000400"></a>Typically, the best evide=
nce of
intent is the contract itself; if an agreement is &quot;complete, clear and
