mber
7 to tender eligible&nbsp;[**30]&nbsp; securities. The exchanges would be
&quot;settled&quot; on December 12, when former bondholders would receive t=
he
secured loans. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal15 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
