ld
in <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Kimmell</i> that a claim of negl=
igent
misrepresentation can succeed only where reliance on the alleged
misrepresentation is justified, and that </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal15 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bott=
om:0in;
margin-left:20.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:15.=
