:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>in determining whether justifiab=
le
reliance exists in a particular case, a fact finder should consider whether=
 the
person making the representation held or appeared to hold unique or special
expertise; whether a special relationship of trust or confidence existed
between the parties; and whether the speaker was aware of the use to which =
the
information would be put and supplied it for that purpose. </span></p>

