mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 250 F.3d 87,
103 (2d Cir. 2001)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-styl=
e:
normal'>Suez Investors</i> thus suggests that where, as here, a &quot;speci=
al
relationship&quot; is nowhere pled, and the allegations with respect to the
other <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Kimmell</i> factors are soft,=
 a
claim for negligent misrepresentation is dismissible under </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:6CHH-WBV3-SCV7-1000-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
