:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> Defendants understandably had an
adverse reaction to Plaintiff's lack of substantive&nbsp;[**16]&nbsp; respo=
nse
to the comprehensively briefed motions, and made an application for sanctio=
ns
