Liquidating Trust,</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:488Y-3SR0-0038-X1WM-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'> 326 F.3d 63,=
 72
(2d Cir. 2003)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-f=
areast-font-family:
Times;color:black'> (quoting </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4JT82MC0K1MNJ2GV00=
00400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-GRN0-003B-P4B8-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
