Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Where subject matter jurisdictio=
n is
proper, federal courts have a &quot;'virtually unflagging obligation'&quot;=
 to
exercise that jurisdiction. </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4JT82MC0K1MNJ2XS000=
0400"></a><a
