style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>&nbsp;[**79]&nbsp;
<u>d. Order in Which Actions Were Filed</u></span></p>

<p class=3DNormal18 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>The
next factor -- the order in which the actions were filed -- clearly weighs =
in
favor of abstention. SSAI filed its action in state court in October 2000. =
<a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4JT82MC0K1MNJ2YW0000400"></a>(Am. Compl. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4JT82MC0K1MNJ2YY0000400"></a>P190) The federal court acti=
on was
filed in October 2004, four years later. However, &quot;priority should not=
 be
measured exclusively by which complaint was filed first, but rather in term=
s of
how much progress has been made on the two actions.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4JT82MC0K1MNJ2YV0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-54V0-003B-S0RY-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Moses H. Cone
Mem'l Hosp.,</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-54V0-003B-S0RY-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'> 460 U.S. at =
21</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4JT82MC0K1MNJ2YY0000400_2"></a>In the state court action,
extensive discovery has been conducted consisting of &quot;the production of
more than 92,000 pages of documents, the taking of more than twenty-five
depositions, and the filing of more than 150 motions, briefs and other plea=
dings.&quot;
</span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4JT82MC0K1MNJ2YX0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:49XS-XWW0-0039-44H5-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Stanley Shenk=
er
and Assocs., Inc.,</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:49XS-XWW0-0039-44H5-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'> 844 A.2d at =
