if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1</spa=
n></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'> of
the Sherman Act has been violated, but it does not indicate whether a priva=
te
plaintiff has suffered antitrust injury and thus may recover damages under =
<i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>&sect; 4</i> of the Clayton Act.&quot;=
 </span><a
