mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Plaintiff's allegation that Jakks
and THQ engaged in bid rigging and price fixing does not change the analysi=
s,
because THQ and Jakks were only two of several competitors for the video ga=
me
license. As in</span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4JT82MC0K1MNJ3NR0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
