if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Groden v. Ran=
dom
House, Inc.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-CVB0-001T-D4PK-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 61 F.3d 104=
5,
1051 (2d Cir. 1995)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (&quot;[S]tatements of opinion =
are
generally not the basis for </span><a
