on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:61XJ-43W3-GXJ9-33DV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Lanham Act</s=
pan></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
liability.&quot;); <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>see also </i></s=
pan><a
