span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4PCS-P8M0-TXFX-42DR-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 497 F.3d at=
 160</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
(quoting </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2HM5X20030000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:417F-7420-0038-X18T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Pizza Hut, In=
c.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:417F-7420-0038-X18T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 227 F.3d at=
 497</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>).
UpCodes's assurances that its products are &quot;[a]lways up to date&quot; =
and
that its users will &quot;never work from outdated code&quot; are not so
patently hyperbolic that it would be implausible for buyers to rely on them.
App'x 33-34, &para; 50. Rather, it seems to us to be plausible that a
reasonable consumer would construe these claims as specific statements about
the quality of UpCodes's offerings and understand them to mean that the cod=
es
published on UpCodes's website accurately reflect the law. Thus, UpCodes co=
uld
prevail&nbsp;[**28]&nbsp; on its puffery defense only after introducing
extrinsic evidence of the statements' effect on consumers on a motion for
summary judgment or at trial. Neither we nor the district court should reso=
lve
this fact-intensive inquiry at the pleadings stage.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal19 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N7W0010000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>We are not persuaded by the dist=
rict
court's reasons for reaching the opposite conclusion. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N7W0030000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2HM5X40040000400"></a>First, the district court re=
lied
on out-of-circuit precedents that &quot;have treated the term[] 'accurate' =
. .
. as puffing language.&quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2HM5X200500=
00400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:62CN-FF21-F4NT-X0PT-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Int'l Code
Council, Inc.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:62CN-FF21-F4NT-X0PT-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 2021 U.S. D=
ist.
LEXIS 66802, 2021 WL 1236106, at *7</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-famil=
y:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N7W0050000400"></a>But other courts' treatment =
of a
specific word is of little help unless that word is used in a sufficiently
similar context. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N7W0050000400_2"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2HM5X40040000400_2"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N7W0030000400_2"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc9_16"></a>Courts &quot;must analyze the message
conveyed in full context&quot; and &quot;must consider the advertisement in=
 its
entirety and not . . . engage in disputatious dissection.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N7W0020000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4PCS-P8M0-TXFX-42DR-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Time Warner</=
span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4PCS-P8M0-TXFX-42DR-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
