if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 497 F.3d at=
 158</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
(internal quotation marks omitted).</span><a style=3D'mso-footnote-id:ftn25=
8'
href=3D"#_ftn258" name=3D"_ftnref258" title=3D""><sup><span style=3D'font-f=
amily:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times'>8</span></sup></a><span style=3D'font-family=
:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> &nbsp;[*62]&nbsp; For example, =
the
term &quot;always&quot; could amount to puffery if it modifies something
subjective. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2HM5X40020000400"></a><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See, e.g., </i></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N7W0040000400"></a><a
