:contentItem:62CN-FF21-F4NT-X0PT-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Int'l Code
Council, Inc.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:62CN-FF21-F4NT-X0PT-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 2021 U.S. D=
ist.
LEXIS 66802, 2021 WL 1236106, at *8</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-famil=
y:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. That may be true,
but ICC did not allege that UpCodes's representations of accuracy statements
are false because UpCodes was slow to update newly enacted codes. Rather, t=
he
complaint alleges that the codes were riddled with blatant errors, such as =
publishing
the entire &quot;text of ICC's model International Residential
Code&nbsp;[**30]&nbsp; 2015 as the 'Residential Code 2015 of Wyoming' even
though Wyoming has not incorporated the entire International Residential Co=
de
2015,&quot; App'x 28, &para; 34, and publishing eleven code appendices as p=
art
of the Building Code 2015 of Wyoming and two code appendices as part of the
Wyoming Fire Code even though Wyoming had never adopted those appendices. A=
pp'x
29, &para;&para; 36, 37. While it might be unreasonable for a consumer to t=
hink
that UpCodes instantaneously updated every code as it was revised, one could
reasonably believe based on UpCodes's representations that its website would
not include obvious omissions and inaccuracies such as these.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal19 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N800030000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Finally, we disagree with the
district court that a disclaimer on Upcodes's website can shield the defend=
ants
from liability at this early stage. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N8000500=
00400"></a>The
district court noted that the website &quot;expressly disclaims liability f=
or
'any errors or omissions in the information or content' on its website,&quo=
t;
which, according to the court, further indicates that the website's stateme=
nts
of accuracy and completeness are mere puffery. </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK28T4SB0020000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I662SCGK2D6N800020000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:62CN-FF21-F4NT-X0PT-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Int'l Code
Council, Inc.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:62CN-FF21-F4NT-X0PT-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
