if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 75 F.3d 801,
808-09 (2d Cir. 1996)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",seri=
f;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (permissible to consider full t=
ext
of documents partially quoted in complaint); </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4M3H2X70K1MNJ09Y0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-CRR0-001T-D42K-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Int'l Audiote=
xt
Network, Inc. v. Am. Tel. &amp; Tel. Co.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-CRR0-001T-D42K-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 62 F.3d 69,=
 72
(2d Cir. 1995)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-f=
areast-font-family:
Times;color:black'> (contract between parties &quot;integral&quot; to compl=
aint
alleging breach and may be considered on a motion to dismiss); </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4M3H2X70K1MNJ0BC0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-7DB0-008H-V05V-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Cortec Indus.,
Inc. v. Sum Holding L.P.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-7DB0-008H-V05V-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 949 F.2d 42,
47-48 (2d Cir. 1991)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (permissible to consider docume=
nts
relied upon by plaintiff in drafting the complaint and integral to the
