pan></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
supports the adoption of the elements approach.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The Rule, which has not been amend=
ed
since its adoption in 1944, is the most recent derivative of the common-law
