:contentItem:3S4X-DS00-003B-H267-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, at 320</spa=
n></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJW6R50K1MNJ3TX0000400_2"></a>In short, the elements app=
roach
was settled doctrine at the time of the Rule's promulgation&nbsp;[****31]&n=
bsp;
and for more than two decades thereafter.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&=
nbsp;
</span>In its restatement of &quot;pre-existing law,&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJW6R50K1MNJ3TW0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-CV60-003B-S2J3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Keeble </span=
></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-CV60-003B-S2J3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>v.</span></i>=
</a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-CV60-003B-S2J3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
