mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 363 U.S. 37=
0,
389 (1960)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-farea=
st-font-family:
Times;color:black'>. The law does not establish a general federal remedy
against fraudulent conduct, with use of the mails as the jurisdictional
