tory
duty to advance funds to reimburse the customers. The issue is whether SIPC=
 can
recover from Holmes under the Racketeer Influenced and Corrupt Organizations
Act (RICO), </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:65TD-2HT3-GXF6-804J-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
