that question, I would hold &nbsp;[*277]&nbsp; that a plaintiff need not be=
 a
purchaser or a seller to assert RICO claims predicated on violations of fra=
ud
in the sale of securities.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal24 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
