mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>17 CFR &sect;
240.10b-5 (1991)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I7TG7198GT5000YV2W3000BC"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FFVT6Y0K1MNJ05N0000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FFVT6Y0K1MNJ05T0000400"></a>In 1971, we ratified without
