if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>58 Notre Dame=
 L.
Rev. 237, 264, n. 76 (1982)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times=
",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. The first line of S. 1861
