)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'> is
not limited to upper management, but we disagree that the &quot;operation or
management&quot; test is inconsistent with this proposition. An enterprise =
is
&quot;operated&quot; not just by upper management but also by lower rung
participants in the enterprise who are under the direction of upper managem=
ent.
</span><a style=3D'mso-footnote-id:ftn328' href=3D"#_ftn328" name=3D"_ftnre=
f328"
title=3D""><sup><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-f=
amily:
Times'>9</span></sup></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-farea=
st-font-family:
Times;color:black'> An enterprise also might be &quot;operated&quot; or
&quot;managed&quot; by others &quot;associated with&quot; the enterprise who
