Arthur Young, which was &quot;associated &nbsp;[****44]&nbsp; with&quot; the
Co-op, &quot;participated&quot; in the Co-op's operation or management. As =
the
Court has noted, &quot;participate&quot; should be read broadly in this
context, see <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>ante</i>, at 178 (citi=
ng </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FFY37W0K1MNJ4C20000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
