<p class=3DNormal26 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>The
petition in No. 91-1111 touches on the interaction of two important pieces =
of
economic legislation. <a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc2_25"></a>The Sherman=
 Act
declares &quot;every contract, combination in the form of trust or otherwis=
e,
or conspiracy, in restraint of trade or commerce among the several States, =
or
with foreign nations, . . . to be illegal.&quot; </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8S9D-W4V2-8T6X-74X3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>15 U.S.C. &se=
ct;
1</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-f=
amily:
Times;color:black'>. <a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc3_25"></a>The
McCarran-Ferguson Act provides that regulation of the insurance industry is
generally a matter for the States, </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8S9D-W4W2-8T6X-714X-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>15 U.S.C. &se=
ct;
1012(a)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-=
font-family:
Times;color:black'>, and (again, &nbsp;[****31]&nbsp; generally) that &quot=
;no
Act of Congress shall be construed to invalidate, impair, or supersede any =
law
enacted by any State for the purpose of regulating the business of
insurance,&quot; </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8S9D-W4W2-8T6X-714X-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1012(b=
)</span></i></a><span
