if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1964(c=
)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
only if the alleged RICO violation was the proximate cause of the plaintiff=
's
injury.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The instant case requ=
ires
us to apply the principles discussed in <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:nor=
mal'>Holmes</i>
to a dispute between two competing businesses. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal29 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
