on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1962(a=
)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
claim.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>It reasoned that Ideal
adequately &nbsp;[*456]&nbsp; pleaded its claim because it alleged an injur=
y by
reason of petitioners' &nbsp;[***728]&nbsp; use and investment of racketeer=
ing
proceeds, &quot;as distinct from injury traceable simply to the predicate a=
cts
of racketeering alone or to the conduct of the business of the
enterprise.&quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4K76R6C0K1MNJ0YX0000400"></a>=
<a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4CS5-W8G0-0038-X04X-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span></span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4CS5-W8G0-0038-X04X-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Id.</span></i=
></a><a
