statute.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Because respondent's
injuries result from petitioners' fraud, and not from New&nbsp;[****34]&nbs=
p;
York's injuries, respondent has a right to recover equal to that of New Yor=
k. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal29 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
