mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 318 F.3d 11=
3,
124 (CA2 2003))</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>, outlined a proximate-causation
standard that falls well in line both with the reasoning behind having a
