as
Title IX to the Organized Crime Control Act.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The Committee Report noted that the
Title &quot;has as its purpose the elimination of the infiltration of organ=
ized
crime and racketeering into legitimate organizations operating in interstate
