mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1962</=
span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>,
without proof of reliance.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;
</span>Accordingly, it cannot be disputed that the Government could prosecu=
te a
person for such behavior.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The=
 terms
