Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Petitioners first argue that RICO
should be read to incorporate a first-party reliance requirement in fraud c=
ases
&quot;under the rule that Congress intends to incorporate the well-settled
meaning of the common-law terms it uses.&quot;<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4TXM1RC0K1MNJ49D0000400"></a><a
