<p class=3DNormal31 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>II </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal31 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Appellate
review of remand orders is limited by </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5HW2-D6RV-H0JP-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>28 U.S.C. &se=
ct;
1447(d)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-=
font-family:
Times;color:black'>, which states: </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal31 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bott=
om:0in;
margin-left:20.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:15.=
0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc4_30"></a><a name=3D"Bookmark_LEDHN4_1_6"></a>=
<span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>[4]<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>&quot;An order remanding a case to=
 the
State court from which it was removed is not reviewable on appeal or otherw=
ise,
except that an order remanding a case to the State court from which it was
removed pursuant to </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5HW2-D6RV-H0JJ-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
