mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>(e) The Second Circuit should de=
cide
in the first instance whether to &nbsp;[***876]&nbsp;remand to the District
Court to allow Iqbal to seek leave to amend his deficient complaint. P. 236=
87</span></p>

