style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>It instead involves a decisionmake=
r's
&nbsp;[****27]&nbsp;undertaking &nbsp;[*677]&nbsp; a course of action
&quot;'because of,' not merely 'in spite of,' [the action's] adverse effects
upon an identifiable group.&quot;<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </=
span><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Ibid.</i><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>It follows that, to state a claim =
based
on a violation of a clearly established right, respondent must plead suffic=
ient
factual matter to show that&nbsp;[**1949]&nbsp; petitioners adopted and
