</span>Complaint P 96, App. to Pet. for Cert. 173a-174a.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The complaint alleges that Ashcrof=
t was
the &quot;principal architect&quot; of this invidious policy,
&nbsp;[*681]&nbsp; <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>id.,</i> P 10, at
