style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span>To be clear, we do not reject these=
 bald
allegations on the ground that they are unrealistic or nonsensical.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>We do not so characterize them any=
 more
than the Court in &nbsp;[***886]&nbsp;<i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:norma=
l'>Twombly</i>
rejected the plaintiffs' express allegation of a &quot;'contract, combinati=
on
or conspiracy to prevent competitive entry,'&quot; </span><a
