<p class=3DNormal33 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Justice
<b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Alito</b> delivered the opinion of=
 the
Court. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal33 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>We
are asked in this case <a name=3D"Bookmark_LEDHN1_1_8"></a>[1] to decide <a
name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc1_32"></a>whether an association-in-fact enter=
prise
under the Racketeer Influenced and Corrupt Organizations Act (RICO), </span=
><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:65TD-2HT3-GXF6-804J-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>18 U.S.C. &se=
ct;
1961 </span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:65TD-2HT3-GXF6-804J-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>et seq</span>=
</i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:65TD-2HT3-GXF6-804J-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>.</span></i><=
/a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>,
must have &quot;an ascertainable structure beyond
&nbsp;[***1273]&nbsp;&nbsp;[*941]&nbsp; that inherent in the pattern of
racketeering activity in which it engages.&quot;<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Pet. for Cert. i.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>We hold that such an enterprise mu=
st
have a &quot;structure&quot; but that an instruction framed in this precise
language is not necessary.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The
District Court properly instructed the jury in this case.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>We therefore affirm the judgment o=
f the
Court of Appeals. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal33 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
