<p class=3DNormal33 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>A </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal33 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>The
evidence at petitioner's trial was sufficient to prove the following:<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Petitioner and others participated=
 in a
series of bank thefts in New York, New Jersey, Ohio, and Wisconsin during t=
he
1990's.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The participants in t=
hese
&nbsp;[****7]&nbsp;crimes included a core group, along with others who were
recruited from time to time.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;
</span>Although the participants sometimes attempted bank-vault burglaries =
and
bank robberies, the group usually targeted cash-laden night-deposit boxes,
which are often found in banks in retail areas. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal33 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Each
theft was typically carried out by a group of participants who met beforeha=
nd
to plan the crime, gather tools (such as crowbars, fishing gaffs, and
walkie-talkies), and assign the roles that each participant would play (suc=
h as
lookout and driver).<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The
participants generally split the proceeds from the thefts.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The group was loosely and informal=
ly
organized.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>It does not appear=
 to
have had a leader or hierarchy; nor does it appear that the participants ev=
er
formulated any long-term master plan or agreement. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal33 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>From
1991 to 1994, the core group was responsible for more than 30 night-deposit=
-box
thefts.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>By 1994, petitioner h=
ad
joined the group, and over the next five years, he participated in numerous
attempted night-deposit-box thefts and at least two attempted bank-vault
burglaries. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal33 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>In
2003, petitioner was indicted for participation in the conduct of the affai=
rs
of an enterprise through a pattern of racketeering &nbsp;[****8]&nbsp;activ=
ity,
in violation of </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>18 U.S.C. &se=
ct;
1962(c)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-=
font-family:
Times;color:black'>;&nbsp;[**2242]&nbsp; conspiracy to commit that offense,=
 in
violation of </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1962(d=
)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>;
conspiracy to commit bank burglary, in violation of </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5032-D6RV-H544-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 371</s=
pan></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>;
and &nbsp;[*942]&nbsp; nine counts of bank burglary and attempted bank
burglary, in violation of </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0RV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
