style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>A </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal33 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Contrary
to petitioner's claims, rejection of his argument regarding these structural
characteristics does not lead to a merger of the crime proscribed by </span=
><a
