ct;
1962(c)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-=
font-family:
Times;color:black'> (participating in the affairs of an enterprise through a
pattern of racketeering activity) and &nbsp;[****21]&nbsp;any of the follow=
ing
offenses:<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>operating a gambling
business, </span><a
