<p class=3DNormal34 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>The
City of New York taxes the possession of cigarettes.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Hemi Group, based &nbsp;[****7]&nb=
sp;in
New Mexico, sells cigarettes online to residents of the City.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Neither state nor city law require=
s Hemi
to charge, collect, or remit the tax, and the purchasers seldom pay it on t=
heir
own.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Federal law, however, re=
quires
out-of-state vendors such as Hemi to submit customer information to the Sta=
tes
into which they ship the cigarettes. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal34 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Against
that backdrop, the City filed this lawsuit under the Racketeer Influenced a=
nd
Corrupt Organizations Act (RICO), alleging that Hemi failed to file the
required customer information with the State.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I66CTJTJ2D6N5X0010000400"></a>That failure, the City argue=
s,
constitutes mail and wire fraud, which caused it to lose tens of millions of
dollars in unrecovered cigarette taxes.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nb=
sp;
</span>Because the City cannot show that it lost the tax revenue &nbsp;[*5]=
&nbsp;
&quot;by reason of&quot; the alleged RICO violation, </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PX-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>18 U.S.C. &se=
ct;
1964(c)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-=
font-family:
Times;color:black'>, we hold that the City cannot state a claim under
RICO.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>We therefore reverse the
Court of Appeals' decision to the contrary. </span></p>

