Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Applying that standard, we rejec=
ted
SIPC's RICO claim.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The alleged
conspiracy, we held, directly harmed only the broker-dealers; SIPC's injury=
, on
the other hand, was &quot;purely contingent&quot; on that harm.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span></span><a
