if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect;&sect;
1964(c)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-=
font-family:
Times;color:black'> (emphasis added), 1962.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>RICO defines &quot;racketeering
activity&quot; to include violations of various predicate criminal statutes
including mail and wire fraud.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </spa=
n></span><a
