Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>The upshot is that the harm is
foreseeable; it is a consequence that Hemi intended, indeed desired; and it
falls well within the set of risks that Congress sought to&nbsp;[**998]&nbs=
p;
prevent.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Neither antitrust an=
alogy
nor any statutory policy of which I am aware precludes a finding of
&quot;proximate &nbsp;[****40]&nbsp;cause.&quot;<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>I recognize that some of our opini=
ons
may be read to suggest that the words &quot;by reason of&quot; in RICO do n=
ot
perfectly track common-law notions of proximate cause.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>See, <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4YD38400K1MNJ4C40000400_2"></a><i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-=
style:
normal'>e.g.</i>, </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4YD38400K1MNJ4C30000400"></a>=
<a
