style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>The treatises &nbsp;[****43]&nbsp;=
say
the same.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>See, <i style=3D'ms=
o-bidi-font-style:
