<p class=3DNormal35 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>These
cases arise from lawsuits filed by the city of Miami alleging that resident=
ial
mortgage lenders engaged in discriminatory lending practices in violation of
