8,
1266 (CA11 2015)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5NMNNGB28T4K20030000400_2"></a>Miami seeks damages from t=
he
lenders for reduced property tax revenues and for the cost of increased
municipal services&#8212;&#8220;police, firefighters, building inspectors,
debris &nbsp;[**692]&nbsp; collectors, and&nbsp;[***23]&nbsp; others&#8221;=
&#8212;deployed
to attend to the blighted areas. </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5NMNNGB28T4K20020000400"></a><a
