<p class=3DNormal35 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Nothing
in the text of the FHA suggests that Congress intended to deviate from the
zone-of-interests limitation. The statute&#8217;s private-enforcement mecha=
nism
provides that only an &#8220;aggrieved person&#8221; may sue, </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SHT-0722-D6RV-H1FN-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
