k'> (a
RICO enterprise is &#8220;a group of persons associated together for a comm=
on
purpose of engaging in a course of conduct&#8221;). He also asserted that
Medical Marijuana&#8217;s false or misleading advertising satisfied the
elements of mail and wire fraud and that those crimes constituted a
&#8220;&#8216;pattern of racketeering activity.&#8217;&#8221; </span><a
