<p class=3DNormal37 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFD2D6MSH0020000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFD2D6MSH0040000400"></a><i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-st=
yle:
normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Ti=
mes;
color:black'>Sedima</span></i><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> holds that &#8220;the compensab=
le <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>injury</i> necessarily is the<i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'> harm </i>caused by predicate acts
sufficiently related to constitute a pattern.&#8221; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFD2D6MSH0010000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-9Y60-0039-N48C-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
