<p class=3DNormal37 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Given
the number of steps in Horn&#8217;s theory and the multiple actors involved,
this requirement may present &nbsp;[***492]&nbsp; an insurmountable
&nbsp;[*613]&nbsp; obstacle in his case. Indeed, even Horn concedes that he
faces &#8220;a heavy burden on remand.&#8221; Tr. of Oral Arg. 45, 63, 70.
There is, after all, some distance between the first link in the chain (Med=
ical
Marijuana&#8217;s misrepresentations) and the last (Horn&#8217;s job loss).=
</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal37 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFH2D6MTM0020000400"></a><i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-st=
yle:
normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Ti=
mes;
color:black'>Second</span></i><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>, <a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFcls=
cc9_26"></a>pleading
a RICO claim is not as simple as pointing to a business or
property&nbsp;[****24]&nbsp; harm. A plaintiff must first establish a patte=
rn
of racketeering activity. </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>18 U. S. C.
&sect;&sect;1962</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>, </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PX-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>1964(c)</span=
></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>.
Doing so requires identifying two or more predicate crimes &#8220;within a
single scheme that were related and that amounted to, or threatened the
likelihood of, continued criminal activity.&#8221; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFH2D6MTM0010000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-9VH0-003B-411T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>H. J. Inc.</s=
pan></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-9VH0-003B-411T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'> v. </span></=
i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-9VH0-003B-411T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Northwestern =
Bell
Telephone Co.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-9VH0-003B-411T-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
