<p class=3DNormal37 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Third</span></i><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>, <a
name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc10_25"></a>the reach of </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PX-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect;1964(c)=
</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
turns on more than the meaning of &#8220;injured.&#8221;&nbsp;[**946]&nbsp;=
 As
we noted at the outset, &#8220;business&#8221; may not encompass every aspe=
ct
of employment, and &#8220;property&#8221; may not include every penny in the
plaintiff &#8217;s pocketbook. Accordingly, not every monetary harm&#8212;b=
e it
lost wages, medical expenses, or otherwise&#8212;necessarily implicates RIC=
O.
Medical Marijuana brushes away this possibility, instead attributing the
broadest definitions to both terms.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal37 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFH2D6MTM0040000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFJ28T41V0010000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFJ28T41V0050000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
