09,
718, n. 7, 125 S. Ct. 2113, 161 L. Ed. 2d 1020 (2005)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>.
And, whether Horn suffered a personal injury is a case-specific factual
finding. Such questions do not ordinarily merit our review. See this
Court&#8217;s </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:5GYC-2C71-6N19-F065-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
