name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFN2N1RP60010000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>In my view, the Court should
interpret the meaning of &#8220;injured in his business or property&#8221; =
in
its entirety. The ordinary rule is that &#8220;a word is known by the compa=
ny
it keeps.&#8221; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFN28T42F0030000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:68DP-VSC1-JNY7-X32Y-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
