style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>First
is the statutory text. RICO expressly distinguishes among different kinds of
injuries&#8212;personal injuries versus business or property injuries.</spa=
n></p>

<p class=3DNormal37 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
