Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Property injury&#8212;like tresp=
ass
or conversion&#8212;is an act &#8220;materially affecting the capacity of
particular property for ordinary use and enjoyment&#8221; or &#8220;the
diminishing&#8221; of one&#8217;s &#8220;property&#8221; by tortious means.
Ballentine&#8217;s , at 627; see </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6FGFYFS2D6MW10010000400"></a><a
