<span
style=3D'font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Opinion</span></b></p>

<p class=3DNormal38 style=3D'line-height:3.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly=
