:contentItem:3VBY-1W80-0039-41NW-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>., 256 A.D.2d
906, 681 N.Y.S.2d 846, 848 (App. Div. 1998)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
&nbsp;[**19]&nbsp;(indicating that repudiation occurs where &quot;the
repudiating party has indicated an unqualified and clear refusal to
