<p class=3DNormal39 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I52FCG760N0BC20040000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I52FCG760N0BC30010000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>As to an &quot;association-in-fa=
ct
enterprise,&quot; the Supreme Court has held that &quot;an association-in-f=
act
enterprise must have an ascertainable structure beyond that inherent in the
pattern of racketeering activity in which it engages.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I52FCG760N0BC20030000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4WGD-3S70-TXFX-12BB-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Boyle</span><=
/i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4WGD-3S70-TXFX-12BB-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 129 S. Ct. =
at
2244</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-fon=
t-family:
Times;color:black'> (internal &nbsp;[**36]&nbsp;quotation marks omitted). <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I52FCG760N0BC30030000400"></a>However, an association-in-f=
act
enterprise under RICO need not have a hierarchical structure, a chain of
command, or other business-like attributes. <u>See </u></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I52FCG760N0BC20050000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4WGD-3S70-TXFX-12BB-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>id</span></i>=
</a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4WGD-3S70-TXFX-12BB-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>. at 2245</sp=
an></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I52FCG760N0BC30030000400_2"></a>&quot;From the terms of RI=
CO, it
is apparent that an association-in-fact enterprise must have at least three
structural features: a purpose, relationships among those associated with t=
he
enterprise, and longevity sufficient to permit these associates to pursue t=
he
enterprise's purpose.&quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I52FCG760N0BC3002000=
0400"></a><a
