(d)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font=
-family:
Times;color:black'> does not permit us to excuse from the reach of the
conspiracy provision an actor who does not himself commit or agree to commit
the two or more predicate acts requisite to the underlying offense. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I52FCG770N0BC70040000400"></a>True, though an
&quot;enterprise&quot; under </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
