<p class=3DNormal40 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>The
Court therefore dismisses plaintiffs' federal claims with prejudice. The
dismissal is, however, without prejudice as to plaintiffs' state-law claims,
which have been dismissed based on a decision not to exercise supplemental
jurisdiction.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal40 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;line-height:15.0pt'><br>
