if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>., 822 F.2d 1=
242,
1247 (2d Cir. 1987)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (holding that, when there are
multiple defendants, &nbsp;[*228]&nbsp; </span><a
