<p class=3DNormal42 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Anderson
alleged that &quot;[d]efendants' conduct has reduced the output of magazines
through the wholesale market.&quot; (Complaint &para; 73; PAC &para; 93.) It
