Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>In its Opinion, the Court found =
that
the alleged antitrust conspiracy was not plausible because &quot;publishers=
 and
national distributors have an economic self-interest in more wholesalers, n=
ot
fewer; more wholesalers yields greater competition, which is good for
