:contentItem:3S4X-C3J0-0039-N12D-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 470 U.S. 56=
4,
575, 105 S. Ct. 1504, 84 L. Ed. 2d 518 (1985)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
(&quot;two or more witnesses&quot; may tell mutually inconsistent but
&quot;coherent and facially plausible stor[ies]&quot;). The choice between =
or
among plausible inferences or scenarios is one for the factfinder, <u>see i=
d</u>.;
</span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I55GFTY228T4GR0030000400"></a><a
