k'>&nbsp;[*185]&nbsp;
<a name=3D"Bookmark_I55GFTY228T4GS0030000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc15_13"></a>The choice between two plausible
inferences that may be drawn from factual allegations is not a choice to be
made by the court on a </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:6CHH-WBV3-SCV7-1000-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
