TWR
itself that TWR and Time would stop doing business with Source, Curtis's
president Castardi--although Curtis did not represent Time and was TWR's
competitor--had said he &quot;knew, 'with 100% certainty'&quot; that Source
would be cut off by TWR, which represented Time. At the same time, Castardi
said he knew with 100% certainty that Bauer--which was represented by DSI a=
nd
