if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1</spa=
n></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'> of
the Sherman Act, <u>see </u></span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I55GFTY22N1R94002000=
0400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:7YJ2-MVT1-2RHS-K0NF-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>American Need=
le,
Inc. v. National Football League</span></i></a><a
