style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Prior
History:</span></b><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-fon=
t-family:
Times;color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;[**1]&nbsp;Appeal from an order of the United
States District Court for the Southern District of New York (Crotty, J.)
denying plaintiff leave to amend its complaint alleging violations of
&sect;&sect; 11,12(a)(2), and 15 of the Securities Act of 1933, on the grou=
nd
that plaintiff's proposed complaint failed to state a claim. See </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8S9D-W4V2-8T6X-753W-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>15 U.S.C.
&sect;&sect; 77k</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>, </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8S9D-W4V2-8T6X-753X-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
