mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>77o</span></i=
></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>.
That complaint alleged that defendants were required to disclose, in connec=
tion
with Ikanos Communications Inc.'s secondary securities offering, known defe=
cts
in the company's semiconductor chips. We hold that, because it plausibly
alleged that the known defects constituted a known trend or uncertainty that
defendants reasonably expected would have a material unfavorable impact on
revenues, see </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dadministrative-cod=
es&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:61RX-V8M3-GXJ9-324R-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
