mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Item 303</spa=
n></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
&#8212; plaintiffs are not seeking the disclosure of the . . . downward tre=
nd
in the real estate market . . . . Rather, plaintiffs claim that Blackstone =
was
required to disclose the manner in which th[at] then-known trend[], event[]=
, or
uncertainly] might reasonably be expected to materially impact Blackstone's
