LEXIS 99593, [WL] at *10</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",s=
erif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. The FDA did approve Neurontin =
for
the treatment of post-herpetic neuralgia (&quot;PHN&quot;), a type of
