if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>2011 U.S. Dis=
t.
LEXIS 99593, [WL] at *6</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",se=
rif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. Pfizer's Neurontin team estima=
ted
that only about ten percent of Neurontin prescriptions that year were for t=
he
