if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>. at 2138,
2143-44</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-=
font-family:
Times;color:black'>. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4T2HM68Y0040000400"></a>Here=
, like
the defendants in <u>Bridge</u>, Pfizer argues that its supposed
misrepresentations went to prescribing doctors, and so the causal link to
Kaiser must have been broken. Even putting aside the evidence
&nbsp;[**35]&nbsp;of Pfizer's direct communications to Kaiser, we think <u>=
Bridge</u>
forecloses this argument. The <u>Bridge</u> Court rejected the attempt to
impose a direct reliance requirement on top of the statutory language provi=
ding
a private right of action under RICO, finding no support for it in the comm=
on
law. <u>See </u></span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4T2HM68Y0030000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4SPS-PSH0-TXFX-12X7-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>id</span></i>=
</a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4SPS-PSH0-TXFX-12X7-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>. at 2139-41<=
/span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>.
We likewise find none here.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal45 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
