bers
-- the parties to whom Pfizer directly made its misrepresentations -- ever =
paid
anything toward a Neurontin prescription, so there is no risk of multiple
recoveries due to a suit by another of those actors.</span><a style=3D'mso-=
footnote-id:
ftn492' href=3D"#_ftn492" name=3D"_ftnref492" title=3D""><sup><span style=
=3D'font-family:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times'>12</span></sup></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>&nbsp;[*38]&nbsp;
<u>See </u></span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4T2HM6900020000400"></a><a
