if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 503 U.S. at=
 269</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4T2HM6900050000400_2"></a>Kaiser is also in the best
position to enforce the law because Kaiser is the party that directly suffe=
red
economic injury from Pfizer's scheme. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4T28T51Y0020000400"></a><u>See </u></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4T2HM6900040000400"></a><a
