if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>., 637 F.3d at
754</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font=
-family:
Times;color:black'>. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2D6ND10050000400"></a>That=
 is
not the situation here. Holding Pfizer liable will have an effect in deterr=
ing
wrongful conduct. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2D6ND20020000400"></a>And the
effect of that wrongful conduct was clear in foresight, not hindsight. <u>S=
ee </u></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2D6ND10040000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:52FW-1VM1-F04K-R033-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>id</span></i>=
</a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:52FW-1VM1-F04K-R033-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>. at 755</spa=
n></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2D6ND20020000400_2"></a>Upholding the finding of
proximate cause here will &quot;protect[] the ability of primary victims of
wrongful conduct to obtain compensation; simplif[y] litigation; recognize[]=
 the
limitations of &nbsp;[*40]&nbsp; deterrence . . . and eliminate[] some actu=
al
or possible but probably minor causes as grounds of legal liability.&quot; =
</span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2D6ND20010000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:52FW-1VM1-F04K-R033-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Id</span></i>=
</a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:52FW-1VM1-F04K-R033-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
