if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>., 194 F.3d 3=
13,
320 (1st Cir. 1999)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2D6ND90050000400_2"></a>Our review of the district
court's admission of Dr. Hartman's testimony is for abuse of discretion, </=
span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2D6ND90040000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
