mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 2011 U.S. D=
ist.
LEXIS 99593, 2011 WL 3852254, at *11 n.6</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-=
family:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal45 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2HM6980050000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>On appeal, Pfizer argues that th=
is
was error because it violated the MDL transfer requirements pursuant to </s=
pan><a
