<p class=3DNormal45 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5FHPVBGM6300000YTK0000M"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2N1RHD0020000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Pfizer is wrong on the law. </sp=
