on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5HW2-D6RV-H0J2-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1404(a=
)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'> to
assign a transferred case to itself for trial.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5889J4V2N1RHD0010000400"></a><a
