if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>523 U.S. at 2=
8</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>.
The coordinated plaintiffs filed their complaint in the District of
Massachusetts; it was not transferred to this district for pretrial
proceedings, and so </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:67F7-7B03-GXF6-81MJ-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1407(a=
)</span></i></a><span
