specifically prohibits false representation of &quot;the character, amount,=
 or
legal status of any debt&quot; and the use of deceptive means &quot;to coll=
ect
or attempt to collect any debt.&quot; </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8S9D-W4W2-8T6X-71SH-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
