if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>(6)(F)(ii)</s=
pan></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
(defining &quot;debt collector&quot; to exclude any officer or employee of a
&quot;creditor&quot; collecting its own debts, or any person collecting a d=
ebt
&nbsp;[*423]&nbsp; &quot;originated by &nbsp;[**16]&nbsp;such person&quot;)=
. </span><a
style=3D'mso-footnote-id:ftn525' href=3D"#_ftn525" name=3D"_ftnref525" titl=
e=3D""><sup><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times'>8</span><=
/sup></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
The Leucadia defendants argue that plaintiffs have failed to sufficiently
