<p class=3DNormal47 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I521F27B0PXTVX0040000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>The Mel Harris defendants argue =
that
their filing of debt collection actions &nbsp;[*424]&nbsp; and affidavits of
