k'>
regarding conduct to require that the defendant &quot;participated in the
operation or management&quot; of the enterprise itself and had &quot;some p=
art
in directing the enterprise's affairs&quot; to be liable. </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I521F27C0PXTX00030000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I521F27C0PXTWX0050000400"></a><a
