complaint alleges that by engaging in &quot;litigation activity&quot;
&nbsp;[**13]&nbsp;to &quot;advance the fee dispute with the Curtis Law
Firm,&quot; the Levy defendants and DeGregorio also committed mail fraud. (=
<u>Id</u>.
81, 88.) Specifically, the complaint alleges that the Levy defendants and
DeGregorio engaged in mail fraud by mailing the following documents to the
