&quot;corruptible&quot; former clients of the Curtis Law Firm (<u>see id</u=
>.
at 21 (&quot;seven vulnerable but greedy, [former clients of plaintiffs], w=
ho
become victims again&quot;)). </span><a style=3D'mso-footnote-id:ftn557'
