if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>28 U.S.C. &se=
ct;
1367(c)(3)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-farea=
st-font-family:
Times;color:black'>. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I51WCTX90YFPSJ0050000400"></a>The =
court
declines to exercise its supplemental jurisdiction over the Complaint's
&nbsp;[**72]&nbsp;state law claims and those claims are therefore dismissed
without prejudice. <u>See id</u>.; <u>see also </u></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I51WCTX90YFPSJ0020000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4D7K-39J0-0038-X0H2-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
