:contentItem:4D7K-39J0-0038-X0H2-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 383 F.3d 34=
, 40
(2d Cir. 2004)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-f=
areast-font-family:
Times;color:black'> (&quot;[B]ecause plaintiffs no longer have any viable
federal claim, any remaining state law claims belong in state, rather than
