rse
of conduct.<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Therefore, since
legitimacy of purpose is not a universal characteristic of the specifically
listed enterprises, it would be improper to engraft this characteristic upon
the second category of enterprises.</span></p>

