th
an established electrical contractor in submitting bids on &quot;public
improvement construction contracts&quot; in New York. (Compl. &para; 20.)
Defendants Jeffrey Deurlein (&quot;Deurlein&quot;), Harry Volande
(&quot;Volande&quot;), and Frank Krutemeier (&quot;Krutemeier&quot;), are
officers and/or employees of Siemens, and are Georgia residents. (<i
