ny was
formally established in August 2004, by an &quot;Operating Agreement&quot;;=
 is
organized under the law of Delaware; and is authorized to conduct business =
in
New York as a limited liability company. (<i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:n=
ormal'>Id.</i>
&para;&para; 14, 35.) Under the Operating Agreement, Siemens and Schlesinger
would split SSE profits 50%-50%, but Siemens retained control over SSE with=
 a
51% member interest as compared to Schlesinger's 49% interest. (<i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Id.</i> &para;&para; 36, 48; Siemens D=
efs.'
Mem. at 5 n.6.) SII, SEA, Deurlein, Volande, Krutemeier, and SSE are
hereinafter collectively referred to as the &quot;Siemens Defendants.&quot;
