mso-fareast-font-family:Times'>3</span></sup></a><span style=3D'font-family=
:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> Under SSE's Operating Agreement,
Schlesinger was permitted to make two appointments to SSE's five-member boa=
rd
of managers; one of those appointments was Weiner. (Compl. &para;&para; 51-=
52.)</span></p>

