family:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. Then on November=
 17,
2009, DDR filed its complaint in this action. The complaint includes eight
counts. First is a RICO claim. Then come several state law claims, confusin=
gly
based sometimes on one, sometimes on another, sometimes on both, and someti=
mes
on neither version of its allegations as to the structure of the business
entities so far described. The two structures can be summarized as follows:=
</span></p>

