The &quot;DDR-in-SFD Entity&quot;: In this version, described, <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>inter alia,</i> in Count Two, compl. &=
para;
235, SSE is a joint venture. The joint venturers in SSE are Siemens and
Schlesinger. SFD is another joint venture. The joint venturers in SFD are
Schlesinger, First Keystone, &nbsp;[**20]&nbsp;and DDR. By virtue of the &q=
uot;Pre-Bidding
and Joint Venture Agreement of SFD Associates,&quot; DDR, as well as
Schlesinger &nbsp;[*641]&nbsp; and First Keystone, each own one-third of
Schlesinger's one-half property interest in SSE.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal0 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-botto=
