one-third of Schlesinger's profits arising from Schlesinger's interest in S=
SE.
In the &quot;DDR-in-SSE Entity&quot; DDR is directly entitled to a share of=
 SSE
profits as a joint venturer or LLC member with Schlesinger, First Keystone,=
 and
Siemens in SSE.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal0 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I52M39S10K3WF40020000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I52M39S10K3WF40040000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
