:contentItem:4XJ8-FFT0-TXFV-V1RN-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 2009 N.Y. M=
isc.
LEXIS 2919, 2009 WL 3415282, at *3</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family=
:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (emphasis added).
&nbsp;[*649]&nbsp; Affirming that ruling, the Second Department stated:
&quot;[T]he documentary evidence . . . conclusively established that DDR was
not a member of SSE. . . . DDR's argument that it was an intended third-par=
ty
beneficiary of the SSE operating agreement was also refuted by the document=
ary
