<p class=3DNormal1 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Here,
the Amended Complaint does not make any reference to Ms. Polack's depositio=
n or
her knowledge of the Defendants. Furthermore, the Plaintiffs do not purport=
 to
have relied on Ms. Polack's deposition in crafting the allegations in the
Amended Complaint relating to the Defendants. <a
