t that
the allegations against the Defendants are based on &quot;voluminous financ=
ial
records obtained through discovery [that] outlines the 'business' relations=
hip
between Rozenberg, YMA, Sheynkman, and Artek.&quot; (Pls.' Opp. at 5.)
Accordingly, Ms. Polack's deposition cannot be considered &quot;incorporate=
d by
reference&quot; or &quot;integral&quot; to the complaint, and therefore the
Court may not consider it in a </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:6CHH-WBV3-SCV7-1000-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
