involvement with Prestige Management (<u>Id.</u> at Ex. B). Accordingly, the
Court grants the Plaintiffs' request for prejudgment attachment as to Prest=
ige.
The Plaintiffs are directed to submit a proposed order of attachment as to
Prestige within 20 days of the date of this order.</span></p>

