the
CDO, inviting him to express &quot;any thoughts or concerns.&quot; <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Id.</i> at 132. Prusko responded,
&quot;Let[']s test the waters!&quot; <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal=
'>Id.</i>
Finally, in March 2007 Prusko sent Wachovia an email to which he attached a
