Sagittarius as &quot;not a pretty bond.&quot; <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-sty=
le:
normal'>Id.</i> at 134.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal3 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>In
March 2007 Plaintiffs invested $5 million in Sagittarius Class A and B notes
each. Both tranches defaulted in October of that year.</span></p>

