if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Rule 12(b)(6)=
</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
that the allegations&nbsp;[**74]&nbsp; themselves give Defendants &quot;some
indication&quot; of the risk concealed by the &nbsp;[*189]&nbsp;
misrepresentations that plausibly materialized in Plaintiffs' ultimately
worthless multimillion-dollar investment in these CDO notes. </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5GPPR422SF8PT0010000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5FS3-V9K1-F04K-J03V-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
