if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Rule 15</span=
></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
&quot;is consistent with our strong preference for resolving disputes on the
merits.&quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I5GPPR422HM63K0010000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:82XR-RSN1-652R-01H3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Williams v.
Citigroup Inc.</span></i></a><a
