:contentItem:82XR-RSN1-652R-01H3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 659 F.3d 20=
8,
212-13 (2d Cir. 2011)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",seri=
f;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (per curiam) (internal quotation
