<p class=3DNormal3 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Here,
the procedure by which the district court denied leave to amend was imprope=
r.
The court required the parties to attend a pre-motion conference and to
exchange, in preparation, letters of no more than three pages regarding
Defendants' anticipated motion to dismiss for failure to state a claim. The
Federal Rules of Civil Procedure do not speak&nbsp;[**78]&nbsp; to the use =
of
pre-motion conferences. Such conferences are not in themselves problematic,
however, and indeed may in many instances efficiently narrow and/or resolve
open issues, obviating the need for litigants to incur the cost of more
extensive filings. The impropriety occurred not when the district court <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>held</i> the pre-motion conference but=
 when,
in the course of the conference, it presented Plaintiffs with a Hobson's
choice: agree to cure deficiencies not yet fully briefed and decided or for=
feit
the opportunity to replead. Without the benefit of a ruling, many a plainti=
ff
will not see the necessity of amendment or be in a position to weigh the
practicality and possible means of curing specific deficiencies.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal3 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5GPPR4228T4YV0010000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5GPPR4228T4YV0050000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Our opinion today, of course, le=
aves
unaltered <a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc27_0"></a>the grounds on which de=
nial
of leave to amend has long been held proper, such as undue delay, bad faith,
dilatory motive, and futility&#8212;none of which were a basis for the deni=
al
here. <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See </i></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5GPPR422HM63K0050000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-H6D0-003B-S3WS-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Foman</span><=
/i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-H6D0-003B-S3WS-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 371 U.S. at=
 182</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5GPPR4228T4YV0020000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:82XR-RSN1-652R-01H3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Williams</spa=
n></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:82XR-RSN1-652R-01H3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 659 F.3d at
213-14</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-f=
ont-family:
Times;color:black'>. No improper purpose is alleged. And while leave may be
denied where amendment would be futile, </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5GPPR4228T4YV0040000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:82XR-RSN1-652R-01H3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Williams</spa=
n></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:82XR-RSN1-652R-01H3-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 659 F.3d at=
 214</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>,
the approach taken by the district court was not rooted in futility. Rather,
