<p class=3DNormal6 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Nicosia
argues that the 2012 Conditions of Use were a browsewrap agreement. Amazon,
like the district court, maintains that the agreement here was neither a
