mso-fareast-font-family:Times'>5</span></sup></a></p>

<p class=3DNormal7 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>&nbsp;[*371]&nbsp;
Defendants also claim that the Complaint fails to plead that the defendants
engaged in &quot;racketeering activity.&quot; Although they acknowledge that
mail fraud constitutes racketeering activity, they claim that Allstate's
allegations of mail fraud are legally insufficient. Specifically, defendants
first complain that Allstate has failed to plead that defendants fraudulent=
ly
incorporated the PCs. Therefore, according to defendants, defendants'
representations that the PCs were eligible for payment under the no-fault l=
aw
do not amount to mail fraud.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal7 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I554PF752SF83C0050000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I554PF752HM6T50020000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>In </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I554PF752SF83C0040000400"></a><a
