if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>State Farm Mu=
tual
Automobile Insurance Co. v. Mallela</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4FTR-4BW0-0039-437B-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
