lscc4_7"></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>&quot;If,
but for the breach, the [plan] would have earned even more than it
actually&nbsp;[**11]&nbsp; earned, there is a 'loss' for which the breaching
fiduciary is liable.&quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I5MJ0BJR2D6NPF0010000=
400"></a><a
