if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Donovan v.
Bierwirth</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-JJN0-0039-P4VM-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 754 F.2d 10=
49,
1056 (2d Cir. 1985)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. &quot;Where several alternative
