<p class=3DNormal9 style=3D'margin-top:6.0pt;line-height:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>BANKERS
TRUST COMPANY, Plaintiff-Appellant, v. DANIEL RHOADES, HERMAN SOIFER and MI=
LTON
BRATEN, Defendants-Appellees</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal9 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
