if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>18 U.S.C. &se=
ct;
1964(c) (1984)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-f=
areast-font-family:
Times;color:black'>. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1N50000400"></a>Mult=
iple
injuries, spread over time, frequently result from the very nature of a RICO
violation. As we have recognized before, congress enacted RICO to deal with=
 a
broadly based, deeply rooted problem by establishing new prohibitions, enha=
nced
sanctions, and new remedies to deal with the activities of those engaged in
illegal practices. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1P10000400"></a><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1N40000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-JK50-0039-P4XB-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Durante Bros.
&amp; Sons, Inc. v. Flushing National Bank</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-JK50-0039-P4XB-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 755 F.2d 23=
9,
248</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font=
-family:
Times;color:black'> (2d Cir.), <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>cert.
denied</i>, <a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1N60000400"></a><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>473 U.S. 906, 87 L. Ed. 2d 654, 105 S.=
 Ct.
3530 (1985)</i> (citing Organized Crime Control Act of 1970, Pub. L. No.
91-452, 84 Stat. 922 (Statement of Findings and Purpose)). <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1P10000400_2"></a>Rather than simply providi=
ng a
new avenue of redress for wrongs cognizable at common law or prohibited by
statute, congress's main goal was to eradicate organized crime. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1PP0000400"></a><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1P00000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-CMY0-001B-K1FH-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Cullen v.
Margiotta</span></i></a><a
