if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 811 F.2d 69=
8,
718</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font=
-family:
Times;color:black'> (2d Cir.), <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>cert.
denied</i>, <a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1P20000400"></a><i
