Ed. 2d
764 (1987)</i>. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1PP0000400_2"></a>To reac=
h this
goal, RICO takes a unique &nbsp;[**20]&nbsp; approach; it looks for a
&quot;pattern&quot; of illegal acts--each of which, standing alone, may inj=
ure
a plaintiff--and then views them together as a single violation. As a resul=
t,
there may be encompassed within a single RICO violation injuries, both mult=
iple
and independent, that occur over a broad span of time. <i style=3D'mso-bidi=
-font-style:
normal'>See generally </i></span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1PN00004=
00"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-9Y60-0039-N48C-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Sedima</span>=
</i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-9Y60-0039-N48C-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
