mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 1964(c=
)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>,
not to the time of the defendant's RICO violation, but to the time when
plaintiff suffers injury to &quot;his business or property&quot; from the
violation. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1RC0000400"></a>Consequently, =
<a
name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc10_6"></a>a plaintiff's action accrues against=
 a
defendant for a specific injury on the date that plaintiff discovers or sho=
uld
have discovered that injury. <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See </=
i></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1PR0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-CMY0-001B-K1FH-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Cullen v.
Margiotta</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-CMY0-001B-K1FH-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 811 F.2d 69=
8,
725</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font=
-family:
Times;color:black'> (2d Cir.) <a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJNC820K1MNJ1RC0000400_=
2"></a>(&quot;under
federal principles, a claim accrues when the plaintiff 'knows or has reason=
 to
know' of the injury that is the basis of the action&quot;) (citation omitte=
d), <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>cert. denied</i>, <a
