normal'>Id.</i> Consequently, after the claims that Bankers has in common w=
ith
BAC are dealt with by the bankruptcy court--through recovery of all or part=
 of
BAC's assets, an order of abandonment, or some other final disposition of t=
he
lost-debt claims--Bankers' injury will be ascertainable, an action as to the
injury will accrue, and Bankers will then have four years to bring a civil =
RICO
action to recover the damages it has suffered in this area, subject of cour=
se
to the normal rules and procedures governing such claims. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal9 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
