mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>AEP Energy Se=
rvs.
Gas Holding Co. v. Bank of Am., N.A.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:51BR-6YJ1-652R-0000-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
