if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 703 F.2d 42=
0,
424 (9th Cir. 1983)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (holding tapes of emergency cal=
ls
were erroneously admitted because the callers were under no business duty to
report); </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJ6B470K1MNJ02B0000400"></a><a
