style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'> by
the courts, acted to narrow its scope. In fact, to the extent that Congress=
 has
amended the mail fraud statute in the recent past, it has done so to ensure=
 a
broader construction than that of the Supreme Court. </span><a
