if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Section 1346<=
/span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>,
adopted in 1988, ensures that <a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc8_9"></a>mail=
 fraud
encompasses &quot;scheme[s] . . . to deprive another of the intangible righ=
t of
honest services&quot; and thereby overrules </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJ6B470K1MNJ0BB0000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-H4V0-003B-44MG-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
