:contentItem:3S4W-WY50-003B-G40W-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>United States=
 v.
Contenti</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4W-WY50-003B-G40W-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 735 F.2d 62=
8,
632 (1st Cir. 1984)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (mailings of notice of loss,
acknowledging receipt of loss, and other mailings part of routine to process
