<p class=3DNormal12 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>The
argument, although respectable at the time it was made, no longer has force=
 in
light of the recent en banc decisions. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJ6B470K1MNJ0G20000400"></a>In <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font=
-style:
normal'>Indelicato</i>, this court held that continuity and relatedness wer=
e,
contrary to <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Ianniello</i> and its
progeny, &quot;essentially characteristics of activity rather than of
enterprise<a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJ6B470K1MNJ0G40000400"></a>. &nbsp;[**39]&=
nbsp;
&quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJ6B470K1MNJ0G10000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-DFP0-003B-51WJ-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>865 F.2d at 1=
382</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJ6B470K1MNJ0G40000400_2"></a>The court specifically sta=
ted
that it saw no &quot;basis in RICO or its legislative history for the
proposition that a RICO violation cannot be established without proof of mo=
re
than one scheme, episode, or transaction, or without proof that the scheme =
pursuant
to which the racketeering acts were performed is a scheme with no apparent
termination date.&quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I4FJ6B470K1MNJ0G30000400=
"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-DFP0-003B-51WJ-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Id.</span></i=
></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-DFP0-003B-51WJ-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'> at 1383</spa=
n></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>.
Accordingly, the defendants' RICO convictions stand. </span><a
