if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 2021 U.S. D=
ist.
LEXIS 233213, 2021 WL 5771154, at *2</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-fami=
ly:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (quoting <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I69VS1PF28T4MD0020000400"></a><i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-st=
yle:
normal'><u>Mandala III</u>, 988 F.3d at 668</i>). This is the sort of case =
in
which it is &quot;appropriate . . . to take into account the nature of the
proposed amendment in deciding whether to vacate the previously entered
judgment.&quot; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I69VS1PF28T4MD0040000400"></a><a
