if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Rule 60(b)(6)=
</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>.
More broadly, I fear that the majority's decision will erode the finality of
judgments throughout this Circuit, significantly undermine the important
purposes served by </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:5GYC-2421-6N19-F16F-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
