style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>,
and increase the workload of busy district court judges who carry the heavi=
est
burden in our system of civil justice. I therefore respectfully dissent from
the majority's opinion and would affirm the district court's order.</span><=
/p>

