against him for, <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>inter alia</i>,
trademark infringement. The defendants moved to dismiss the action for fail=
ure
to state a claim under </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:6CHH-WBV3-SCV7-1000-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
