me Kim
filed this suit, there was no binding precedent in this Circuit as to wheth=
er
litigation activities could serve as predicate acts for purposes of RICO.
Indeed, some courts had endorsed the viability of some such claims. <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See </i></span><a
