ily:
Times;color:black'>&nbsp;DENNIS JACOBS</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal15 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;line-height:17.0pt;page-brea=
k-after:
avoid'><a name=3D"Opinion_14"></a><b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>=
<span
style=3D'font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>Opinion</span></b></p>

<p class=3DNormal15 style=3D'line-height:3.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly=
'><span style=3D'mso-ignore:vglayout;position:
 relative;z-index:251689984;left:-2px;top:0px;width:686px;height:4px'><img
 width=3D686 height=3D4 src=3D"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhrgIEAHcAMSH+Gl=
