if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>F.T.C. v.
Sterling Drug, Inc.</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-2PR0-0039-Y276-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
