mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 188 F.2d 46=
8,
469-70, 47 F.T.C. 1821 (2d Cir. 1951)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-fam=
ily:
"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (cited at 49).
Plaintiffs rely on these cases and ask us to adopt their logic to the analy=
sis
