he
plaintiff to amend the complaint after such a deadline, but the plaintiff m=
ay
do so only up a showing of the &quot;good cause&quot; that is required to
modify a scheduling order under </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:6G8Y-9H73-RS41-G0S7-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Rule 16(b)(4)=
</span></i></a><span
