on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><b
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:norma=
l'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#007=
7CC;
background:white'>Section 1962(c)</span></i></b></a><b style=3D'mso-bidi-fo=
nt-weight:
normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Ti=
mes;
color:black'> theory of recovery</span></b></p>

<p class=3DNormal17 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5T6X5H52D6NW90050000400"></a><a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFc=
lscc17_5"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Section 1962(=
c)
of title 18</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fare=
ast-font-family:
Times;color:black'> makes it unlawful &quot;for any person employed by or
associated with any enterprise engaged in, or the activities of which affec=
t,
interstate or foreign commerce, to conduct or participate, directly or
indirectly, in the conduct of such enterprise's affairs through a pattern of
racketeering activity.&quot; The existence of an
&quot;enterprise&quot;&#8212;one existing&nbsp;[**43]&nbsp; &quot;separate =
and
apart from the pattern of activity in which it engages&quot;&#8212;is a
necessary element of a </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5042-D6RV-H0PV-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>section 1962(=
c)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
violation. </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I5T6X5H52D6NW90040000400"></a><a
