fact
. . . &nbsp;[**13]&nbsp; the moving party is entitled to a judgment as a ma=
tter
of law . . . where the record taken as a whole could not lead a rational tr=
ier
of fact to find for the non-moving party.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FCBV6Y0K1MNJ2VM0000400"></a><a
