if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>First Amendme=
nt</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
rights: (i) Was the rule &quot;justified without reference to the content of
the regulated speech;&quot; (ii) Did&nbsp;[**19]&nbsp; the rule &quot;serve=
 a
significant governmental interest;&quot; and (iii) Did the rule &quot;leave
open ample alternative channels for communication of the information.&quot;=
 </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FCBV6Y0K1MNJ2Y50000400"></a><a
