<p class=3DNormal20 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc2_18"></a><a name=3D"Bookmark_I6BFKS0M2D6MY300=
40000400"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I6BFKS0N28T4K90010000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>District courts have the
&quot;inherent authority to manage their dockets&quot; to promote &quot;the
efficient and expedient resolution of cases.&quot; </span><a
