period or until such time because of the absence of consideration for the
assurance of irrevocability.&nbsp;[**15]&nbsp; When such a writing states t=
hat
the offer is irrevocable but does not state any period or time of
irrevocability, it shall be construed to state that the offer is irrevocable
for a reasonable time.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal21 style=3D'text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt'><span
