Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>The plain language of the writin=
gs
themselves is sufficient to establish the enforceability of the settlement
offer. They were also accompanied by many statements of the Republic,</span=
><a
style=3D'mso-footnote-id:ftn458' href=3D"#_ftn458" name=3D"_ftnref458" titl=
