&quot;Proposal,&quot; &quot;Instructions for Bondholders to Accept the Offe=
r of
Settlement&quot; -- establish the nature of the documents. Given my colleag=
ues'
ruling, the titles should be changed to &quot;Irrelevant Nullity&quot; and
&quot;Invitation to Bondholders to Make an Offer of Settlement.&quot;</span=
></p>

