name=3D"Bookmark_I4X29H2SVX6000076PF00033"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5XNGX7J2HM6HV0050000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>There is also a difference betwe=
en
fraudulent promotion of &quot;off-label&quot; uses for a prescription drug =
as
in </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I5XNGX7J2HM6HV0040000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5PPC-P271-F04K-R0V5-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Sidney Hillma=
n</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5PPC-P271-F04K-R0V5-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 873 F.3d at=
 575</span></i></a><span
