:contentItem:3S4V-P1R0-0039-K4DH-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>42 Bankr. 633,
636 (Bankr. E.D. Pa. 1984)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times"=
,serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (ruling that plaintiff in that =
case
was a beneficiary of a </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8S6M-SWF2-D6RV-H37D-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&sect; 196(b)=
</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
statutory trust of which Arbogast was trustee). Liberty Mutual should have =
an
opportunity to proffer admissible evidence on this issue. As stated in 10A
