upheld charges similar to those made in <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:nor=
mal'>Eckhardt</i>
where an indictment has alleged a scheme to defraud the Government of money=
. <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See </i></span><a
