:contentItem:3S3K-0DW0-003D-G0NY-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Shaffer,</spa=
n></i></a><a
