<p class=3DNormal25 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Weinstein
was not prejudiced by Judge Sifton's decision, made after the charging
conference, to revise the proposed charge as to the elements of witness
bribery. When the issue was raised in &nbsp;[**23]&nbsp; the charging
conference, the Government objected to the proposed charge. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FHBSR40K1MNJ2250000400"></a>Following an exchange betwee=
n the
Court and the Government on the question of whether the Government had to p=
rove
the actual falsity of the testimony sought by the defendant, Judge Sifton s=
aid,
&quot;All right. I'll consider that exception.&quot; Weinstein was on notice
that his requested charge was the subject of further consideration and could
not have been &quot;substantially misled&quot; by the Court in formulating =
his
summation argument, which contended that the Government had to prove the ac=
tual
falsity of the testimony sought. <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Cf=
.<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span></i></span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FHBSR40K1MNJ2240000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-14N0-0039-Y0JW-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Wright v. Uni=
ted
States,</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-14N0-0039-Y0JW-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'> 339 F.2d 578,
579-80 </span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-14N0-0039-Y0JW-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>&nbsp;[*257]&=
nbsp;</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:3S4X-14N0-0039-Y0JW-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
