if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Sixth Amendme=
nt</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
right to effective assistance of counsel in this case. <a
