style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>In
this case, the district court concluded that the entire controversy doctrine
did not bar the assertion of Stochastic's claims. No underlying rationale w=
as
articulated, but some colloquy indicates that the court relied upon the fact
that Stochastic was asserting RICO claims in this action. </span></p>

<p class=3DNormal26 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heig=
ht:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I1KHVH2CMVY000PRNK60057C"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4FH5Y1T0K1MNJ0XH0000400"></a><a
