f;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>In <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-sty=
le:
normal'>United Food &amp; Commercial Workers Central Pennsylvania &amp;
Regional Health &amp; Welfare Fund v. Amgen, Inc.</i>, the plaintiffs sued
Amgen, Inc. for concealing adverse test results about a drug's off-label us=
es. </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5XNGX7F28T4JK0040000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5192-CGY1-652R-800F-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
