i-font-size:
12.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077C=
C;
background:white'>Ninth Circuit Rule 36-3(a)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times",seri=
f;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>, we are free to decide this iss=
ue
in the first instance.</span></p>

