><sup><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times'>4</span><=
/sup></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'> It
is plausible that &nbsp;[*36]&nbsp; the significant restructuring undertake=
n by
the Town and resulting in the loss of Kopchik's position would take longer =
to
