:contentItem:54CC-R7P1-F04K-J045-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Richards-Byer=
s</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:54CC-R7P1-F04K-J045-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 449 Fed. Ap=
px.
at 57</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-fo=
nt-family:
Times;color:black'>.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal1 style=3D'margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I4SPNT7Y6P9000063K60012H"></a><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5V2SRRN2N1R9H0050000400"></a><span style=3D'font-family:"=
Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>As we explained in <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Littlejohn v. City of New York</i>, ho=
wever,
<a name=3D"Bookmark_LNHNREFclscc4_0"></a>a plaintiff &quot;need only give
