pan><a
style=3D'mso-footnote-id:ftn12' href=3D"#_ftn12" name=3D"_ftnref12" title=
=3D""><sup><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times'>3</span><=
/sup></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'> F5
voted against the merger, but 95.6% of Star Bulk's shareholders approved the
