<p class=3DNormal2 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
t:15.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>Second,
Star Bulk purchased 34 dry bulk vessels from Excel Maritime Carriers Ltd.
(&quot;Excel Transaction&quot;), at what F5 claims was a dramatically infla=
ted
price. Because the Excel Transaction was not structured as a merger, Star
