mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 498 U.S. 42=
6,
428, 111 S. Ct. 858, 112 L. Ed. 2d 951 (1991)</span></i></a><span
style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:blac=
k'>
(per curiam). At the time of removal, F5's complaint contained a class-acti=
on
claim that met CAFA's other jurisdictional requirements, including a $5 mil=
lion
amount in controversy and minimal&nbsp;[**20]&nbsp; diversity. <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>See</i> </span><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dstatutes-legislati=
on&amp;id=3Durn:contentItem:8SG9-5HW2-D6RV-H0G4-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>28 U.S.C. &se=
ct;
1332(d)(2)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;mso-farea=
st-font-family:
Times;color:black'>; </span><a name=3D"Bookmark_I5NKV27S2N1RG10050000400"><=
/a><a
