k'> is
to prevent opportunistic plaintiffs from thwarting the complete diversity
requirement by joining claims against non-diverse parties in the same action
with claims against diverse parties. <a name=3D"Bookmark_I5NKV27S28T41K0050=
000400"></a>This
case does not implicate that concern. Here, the plaintiff chose a state cou=
rt
