if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 746 A.2d 24=
4,
254 (Del. 2000)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'>. <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5NKV27S2N1RG60030000400"></a>&quot;Delaware law does not =
permit
the wholesale imputation of one director's knowledge to every other for dem=
and
excusal purposes. Rather, a derivative complaint must plead facts <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>specific to each director</i>, demonst=
rating
that at least half of them could not have exercised disinterested business
judgment in responding to a demand.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5NKV27S2HM6TH0050000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4NYT-HWG0-TXFP-235F-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Desimone v.
Barrows</span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4NYT-HWG0-TXFP-235F-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>, 924 A.2d 90=
8,
943 (Del. Ch. 2007)</span></i></a><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:black'> (emphasis in original, footnotes
omitted). <a name=3D"Bookmark_I5NKV27S2N1RG60030000400_2"></a>Even so, the =
court
must &quot;consider all the particularized facts pled&nbsp;[**38]&nbsp; by =
the
plaintiffs about the relationships between the director and the interested
party in their totality and not in isolation from each other.&quot; <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5NKV27S2N1RG60020000400"></a><i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-st=
yle:
normal'>Del. Cty. Empl. Ret. Fund, 124 A.3d at 1019</i>.</span></p>

<p class=3DNormal2 style=3D'margin-top:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-heigh=
