of
the corporation (or persons) doing the controlling.&quot; <i style=3D'mso-b=
idi-font-style:
normal'>Id.</i> (internal quotation marks and citation omitted). <a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5NKV27S28T41M0020000400"></a>&quot;[T]he mere fact that
[Oaktree], an alleged controlling stockholder, played some role in the
nomination process should not, without additional evidence, automatically
foreclose a director's potential independence.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5NKV27S2SF8BF0020000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5GF3-5341-F04C-G015-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Teamsters Uni=
on </span></i></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:5GF3-5341-F04C-G015-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
