ple
normally get appointed to boards through personal contacts.&quot; </span><a
name=3D"Bookmark_I5NKV27S2SF8BF0040000400"></a><a
href=3D"https://plus.lexis.com/api/document?collection=3Dcases&amp;id=3Durn=
:contentItem:4HVV-W8B0-TVSY-W28V-00000-00&amp;context=3D"><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times",ser=
if;
mso-fareast-font-family:Times;color:#0077CC;background:white'>Benihana of
